{
    "title": "Country Balls: World War",
    "description": "Capture new territories, upgrade your state, build a strong economy and lead your Country Balls army to victory! Play as you like! Rush into the fight, crush the enemy empire, or build your city into a huge state! Do it in real-time in this tactical game and play with a style! Be wise, use your logic and win the fight! Capture enemy states in this fun simulator! This will be epic!\r\n\r\nCountry Balls: World War is a strategy game where you will need to cope with various difficulties, make deals with other countries, increase the power of your army and capture new territories. Command your own cell army and lead it into epic battles! Connect the dots and engage in intense RTS battles for global domination! Take a risk! Use the best strategy and logic to win the war! Rush into city wars! Crush your enemy, takeover the state and build your own empire! It's your choice to become a wise commander or take the path of dictators. Unleash your tactics, establish your reign of glory, and prepare for a clash all over the world in this simulation game.\r\n\r\nTakeover the city and conquest the state! Use logic and tactics in this real-time strategy game! Choose any country and lead it to victory in the battle across the map. Fight for every piece of land in your state. Cross the seas to explore other continents and conquer the whole world! Fight for your empire!  Capture enemy city with all your logic in this simulator game! Show everyone that you\u2019re wise leader and don\u2019t forget to have a fun! \r\n\r\nLead your country balls warriors into the battleground and fight for global domination. The battle consists of capturing territories, accumulating resources, and moving an army between them. Sound simple? Maybe, but be careful, the enemies do the same. Several states can participate in the battle at the same time. Come up with a strategy and win the war around the world! Takeover the city and make it a part of your own empire! Use the best tactics in battles in this country balls wars game. Build the greatest state of all time! \r\n\r\nGet ready for an epic clash and conquest the world! Use your tactical skills and win with a style! Crush dictators and takeover the city. Upgrade your state, increase your combat power on the borders and improve the economy in the heart of your country! \r\n\r\nUse your strategic thinking and logic and win the battle! At first glance, everything is simple - collect a large army and attack, but remember that resources are limited and you need to think about the defense. Move troops and outsmart your opponents. Test your tactical skills and lead your country balls army to victory. Don\u2019t be afraid to risk and conquer nearby countries! Lead your army to glory and establish domination in this dots wars strategy game.\r\n\r\nChoose your favorite customization! The game has many options for personalizing your avatar and you can definitely find what you like.\r\n\r\nAlso, for advanced players, there is a special option - nuclear weapons. Demolish enemy countries from the face of the earth and seize the liberated territories without a battle!\r\n\r\nRule the country and cope with various difficulties in real-time. Unleash the power of your cell army and conquer new lands in this RTS game! Constantly appearing enemies, economic recession, political deals - react and make wise decisions. \r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES\r\n\r\n- Choose your country\r\n- Use logic to come up with a perfect strategy\r\n- Upgrade your territory\r\n- Command troops and army\r\n- Use special options like nuclear weapons\r\n- Deal with real-time events\r\n- Win the war and conquer the world\r\n\r\nPrepare your state for an epic clash! Build your empire and takeover the enemy city. Rush in and play this real-time tactical strategy! Be a wise commander, raise an army, lead troops into battle, and use logic to outsmart your opponents! Manage the economy, overthrow dictators, and upgrade territories to make your state the greatest. Are you ready for world domination? Download Country Balls: World War right now for free!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Capture new territories, upgrade your state, build a strong economy and lead your Country Balls army to victory! Play as you like! Rush into the fight, crush the enemy empire, or build your city into a huge state! Do it in real-time in this tactical game and play with a style! Be wise, use your logic and win the fight! Capture enemy states in this fun simulator! This will be epic!<br><br>Country Balls: World War is a strategy game where you will need to cope with various difficulties, make deals with other countries, increase the power of your army and capture new territories. Command your own cell army and lead it into epic battles! Connect the dots and engage in intense RTS battles for global domination! Take a risk! Use the best strategy and logic to win the war! Rush into city wars! Crush your enemy, takeover the state and build your own empire! It&#39;s your choice to become a wise commander or take the path of dictators. Unleash your tactics, establish your reign of glory, and prepare for a clash all over the world in this simulation game.<br><br>Takeover the city and conquest the state! Use logic and tactics in this real-time strategy game! Choose any country and lead it to victory in the battle across the map. Fight for every piece of land in your state. Cross the seas to explore other continents and conquer the whole world! Fight for your empire!  Capture enemy city with all your logic in this simulator game! Show everyone that you\u2019re wise leader and don\u2019t forget to have a fun! <br><br>Lead your country balls warriors into the battleground and fight for global domination. The battle consists of capturing territories, accumulating resources, and moving an army between them. Sound simple? Maybe, but be careful, the enemies do the same. Several states can participate in the battle at the same time. Come up with a strategy and win the war around the world! Takeover the city and make it a part of your own empire! Use the best tactics in battles in this country balls wars game. Build the greatest state of all time! <br><br>Get ready for an epic clash and conquest the world! Use your tactical skills and win with a style! Crush dictators and takeover the city. Upgrade your state, increase your combat power on the borders and improve the economy in the heart of your country! <br><br>Use your strategic thinking and logic and win the battle! At first glance, everything is simple - collect a large army and attack, but remember that resources are limited and you need to think about the defense. Move troops and outsmart your opponents. Test your tactical skills and lead your country balls army to victory. Don\u2019t be afraid to risk and conquer nearby countries! Lead your army to glory and establish domination in this dots wars strategy game.<br><br>Choose your favorite customization! The game has many options for personalizing your avatar and you can definitely find what you like.<br><br>Also, for advanced players, there is a special option - nuclear weapons. Demolish enemy countries from the face of the earth and seize the liberated territories without a battle!<br><br>Rule the country and cope with various difficulties in real-time. Unleash the power of your cell army and conquer new lands in this RTS game! Constantly appearing enemies, economic recession, political deals - react and make wise decisions. <br><br>GAME FEATURES<br><br>- Choose your country<br>- Use logic to come up with a perfect strategy<br>- Upgrade your territory<br>- Command troops and army<br>- Use special options like nuclear weapons<br>- Deal with real-time events<br>- Win the war and conquer the world<br><br>Prepare your state for an epic clash! Build your empire and takeover the enemy city. Rush in and play this real-time tactical strategy! Be a wise commander, raise an army, lead troops into battle, and use logic to outsmart your opponents! Manage the economy, overthrow dictators, and upgrade territories to make your state the greatest. Are you ready for world domination? Download Country Balls: World War right now for free!",
